      259.3,
      482.9,
      322.9
    ],
    "caption": "Figure 10: Quantization: Stress-testing multiple evaluation metrics through quantization. For several metrics, a subset of unlearned models shows increased metric values after quantization, falling into the red-shaded region: suggesting that the metrics failed to initially capture the presence of knowledge and are therefore not robust. These results are reported only for models unlearned with low learning rates and high utility.",
